   "id": "title-cell",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 🧠 Parallel Memory — Feedback Loop & Retraining Pipeline\n",
    "### Combined: Memory Drift AI + Continuous Learning System\n",
    "\n",
    "**What this notebook does:**\n",
    "1. Collects structured user feedback on AI outputs\n",
    "2. Logs exceptions (low-confidence, wrong predictions)\n",
    "3. Stores feedback in SQLite (synced to Google Drive)\n",
    "4. Triggers retraining automatically when threshold is hit\n",
    "5. Fine-tunes the model using LoRA (memory-efficient)\n",
    "6. Evaluates new model vs old model before replacing\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
  {
